    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Raymond Potterton are delighted to present this large three-bedroom, three-bathroom duplex, ideally positioned on the first floor and extending to approximately 115 sq.m. Within walking distance to Enfield and all local amenities.\n\nThe property features an attractive red brick and pebble dash exterior, along with two allocated parking spaces.\n\nThe property offers a bright, spacious and welcoming interior, with generous living accommodation and excellent storage throughout.\n\nThere are three well-proportioned double bedrooms and three bathrooms, making this an ideal home for families, professionals or those seeking additional space.\n\nThe property benefits from a private balcony overlooking a large communal garden, providing a pleasant outdoor space.\n\nIdeally located in Enfield, the property is within walking distance of local schools, shops, pubs and cafés.\n\nThe train station is just a five-minute walk away, offering excellent access to Dublin and surrounding areas. Dublin Airport is approximately 55 km away, with Dublin City Centre approximately 45 km from the property.\n\nAccommodation includes Entrance Hall, Lounge, Guest w.c, Kitchen/Dining, Utility Room, 3 Bedrooms (main ensuite) and Bathroom.\n\nACCOMMODATION\n\nEntrance Hall - 4.7 x 1.1\nWith tiled flooring.\n\nHallway - 3.9 x 2.2\nWith carpet.\n\nKitchen - 5.2 x 4.3\nWith tiled flooring, built in wall and floor units, oven, hob, extractor fan and dishwasher.\n\nUtility room -1.5 x 1.2\nWashing machine.\n\nStorage room - 2.3 x 0.8\n\nLounge - 6.3 x 5.2\nWith wooden flooring and balcony door.\n\nGuest w.c. - 2.2 x 1.4\nWith tiled flooring, w.c and w.h.b.\n\nLanding - 4.1 x 1.4\nWith Lino flooring.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.1 x 3.1\nWith laminate flooring and built-in wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite - 3.7 x 1.8\nWith tiled flooring w.h.b, w.c and shower.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.9 x 2.6\nWith laminate flooring and built-in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.1 x 2.8\nWith laminate flooring and built-in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 2.3 x 2.2\nWith tiled flooring, w.h.b, w.c, bath and shower.\n\nFEATURES\n\n• Bright and bright and spacious throughout\n• Three double bedrooms with built-in wardrobes\n• Gas fired central heating\n• Double glaze PVC fascia and soffit\n• Double glazed windows\n• Two parking spaces\n• Communal garden\n• Walking distance to Enfield\n• Walking distance to the train station\n\nDIRECTIONS\n\nEIRCODE: A83 TE83"
      },
